### Register User
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
{
    "name": "Abdul",
    "username": "abdul",
    "password": "rahasia"
}

### Login User
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
{
    "username": "abdul",
    "password": "rahasia"
}

